                   ;                        ; medPage0000; "Medium Page 0000 — Infrastructure Monitoring"; "Infrastructure Monitoring"; "Infrastruktur-Überwachung"; "Surveillance de l'infrastructure"; "Monitoreo de infraestructura"; MediumPageLayout; med-page-0000; false; approved
